Stormstrike
    Events
        Unit - A unit Starts the effect of an ability
    Conditions
        (Ability being cast) Equal to ENHANCEMENT_Stormstrike 
    Actions
        -------- == ABILITY MODIFIER == --------
        Set VariableSet Ability_TempLevel = (Level of (Ability being cast) for (Triggering unit))
        Set VariableSet Ability_TempAmount = (Ability_Stormstrike_Base[Ability_TempLevel] + (1.50 x (Real((Strength of (Triggering unit) (Include bonuses))))))
        -------- ==   == --------
        Sound - Play Stormstrike <gen> at 100.00% volume, attached to (Triggering unit)
        -------- I'll create some variables at first to make things easier. --------
        Set VariableSet StormstrikeCaster = (Triggering unit)
        Set VariableSet StormstrikePoints[1] = (Position of StormstrikeCaster)
        Set VariableSet StormstrikePoints[2] = (StormstrikePoints[1] offset by 50.00 towards (Facing of StormstrikeCaster) degrees.)
        -------- Now let's create a dummy to cast the damage that we has just created. --------
        Unit - Create 1 DummyStormstrike for (Owner of StormstrikeCaster) at StormstrikePoints[2] facing Default building facing degrees
        Set VariableSet StormstrikeDummy = (Last created unit)
        -------- I'm adding expiration time to make it disappear after 0.5 second, and give it an ability. --------
        Unit - Add a 0.50 second Generic expiration timer to StormstrikeDummy
        -------- check for Stormstrike Level (1-5) --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Level of ENHANCEMENT_Stormstrike  for StormstrikeCaster) Equal to 1
            Then - Actions
                Unit - Add ENHANCEMENT_StormstrikeDamageLevel1  to StormstrikeDummy
                Ability - Set Ability: (Unit: StormstrikeDummy's Ability with Ability Code: ENHANCEMENT_StormstrikeDamageLevel1 )'s Real Level Field: Damage Per Target ('Efk1') of Level: ((Level of ENHANCEMENT_StormstrikeDamageLevel1  for StormstrikeDummy) - 1) to Ability_TempAmount
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Level of ENHANCEMENT_Stormstrike  for StormstrikeCaster) Equal to 2
            Then - Actions
                Unit - Add ENHANCEMENT_StormstrikeDamageLevel2  to StormstrikeDummy
                Ability - Set Ability: (Unit: StormstrikeDummy's Ability with Ability Code: ENHANCEMENT_StormstrikeDamageLevel2 )'s Real Level Field: Damage Per Target ('Efk1') of Level: ((Level of ENHANCEMENT_StormstrikeDamageLevel2  for StormstrikeDummy) - 1) to Ability_TempAmount
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Level of ENHANCEMENT_Stormstrike  for StormstrikeCaster) Equal to 3
            Then - Actions
                Unit - Add ENHANCEMENT_StormstrikeDamageLevel3  to StormstrikeDummy
                Ability - Set Ability: (Unit: StormstrikeDummy's Ability with Ability Code: ENHANCEMENT_StormstrikeDamageLevel3 )'s Real Level Field: Damage Per Target ('Efk1') of Level: ((Level of ENHANCEMENT_StormstrikeDamageLevel3  for StormstrikeDummy) - 1) to Ability_TempAmount
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Level of ENHANCEMENT_Stormstrike  for StormstrikeCaster) Equal to 4
            Then - Actions
                Unit - Add ENHANCEMENT_StormstrikeDamageLevel4  to StormstrikeDummy
                Ability - Set Ability: (Unit: StormstrikeDummy's Ability with Ability Code: ENHANCEMENT_StormstrikeDamageLevel4 )'s Real Level Field: Damage Per Target ('Efk1') of Level: ((Level of ENHANCEMENT_StormstrikeDamageLevel4  for StormstrikeDummy) - 1) to Ability_TempAmount
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Level of ENHANCEMENT_Stormstrike  for StormstrikeCaster) Equal to 5
            Then - Actions
                Unit - Add ENHANCEMENT_StormstrikeDamageLevel5  to StormstrikeDummy
                Ability - Set Ability: (Unit: StormstrikeDummy's Ability with Ability Code: ENHANCEMENT_StormstrikeDamageLevel5 )'s Real Level Field: Damage Per Target ('Efk1') of Level: ((Level of ENHANCEMENT_StormstrikeDamageLevel5  for StormstrikeDummy) - 1) to Ability_TempAmount
            Else - Actions
        -------- It's time to cast them! So let's add this action. --------
        Unit - Order StormstrikeDummy to Night Elf Warden - Fan Of Knives.
        -------- Time to remove leaks in order to prevent ingame lags. --------
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_StormstrikePoints[1])
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_StormstrikePoints[2])
        -------- You're done! --------
        -------- Q: Why do you use Warden - Fan of Knives ability to order dummy cast spells? --------
        -------- A: Because we the melee damage spell was based from Fan of Knives. --------
